@startuml sequence_send_command
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Send a command and receive a response

participant "Issuer App" as App
participant "MessageBus" as Bus
participant "PendingReplies" as Pend
database "Redis" as Redis
participant "Responder Service" as Resp

App -> Bus: SendAsync(new StartSimulation(...))
Bus -> Pend: Register(correlationId, timeout)
Bus -> Redis: PUBLISH cmd.Contracts.StartSimulation\n{ correlationId, replyTo, payload }

Redis -> Resp: deliver on cmd.Contracts.StartSimulation
Resp -> Resp: Pipeline.log + validate
Resp -> Resp: IRespond<StartSimulation, Ack>.RespondAsync()
Resp -> Redis: PUBLISH rep.{svc}.{instance}\n{ correlationId, payload = Ack }

Redis -> Bus: deliver on reply channel
Bus -> Pend: TryComplete(correlationId, payload)
Bus --> App: StartSimulationAck

note over App
    On no-reply within timeout,
    SendAsync throws TimeoutException.
end note

@enduml
